 Fmt_test;F
 F←Lib.Fmt
 '3.50' ExpectEq 2 F.Fixed 3.5
 '-0.25' ExpectEq 2 F.Fixed ¯0.25
 (,'3') ExpectEq 0 F.Fixed 3.4
 ('1.0' '2.5') ExpectEq 1 F.Fixed 1 2.5
 '1,234,567' ExpectEq F.Commas 1234567
 '-1,234.57' ExpectEq 2 F.Commas ¯1234.567
 '999' ExpectEq F.Commas 999
 '$1,234.50' ExpectEq F.Money 1234.5
 '-$1,234.50' ExpectEq F.Money ¯1234.5
 '€0.99' ExpectEq '€' F.Money 0.99
 '25.6%' ExpectEq F.Pct 0.256
 '50%' ExpectEq 0 F.Pct 0.5
 '512 B' ExpectEq F.Bytes 512
 '1.5 KB' ExpectEq F.Bytes 1536
 '2.0 MB' ExpectEq F.Bytes 2×1024*2
 '850 ms' ExpectEq F.Duration 850
 '4.2 s' ExpectEq F.Duration 4200
 '3m 05s' ExpectEq F.Duration 185000
 '1h 02m' ExpectEq F.Duration 3720000
 '    42' ExpectEq 6 F.PadL 42
 'ab    ' ExpectEq 6 F.PadR 'ab'
 'abcdef' ExpectEq 3 F.PadL 'abcdef'          ⍝ never cuts
 '  abc  ' ExpectEq 7 F.Center 'abc'
 '3 orders' ExpectEq 3 F.Plural 'order'
 '1 order' ExpectEq 1 F.Plural 'order'
 '2 children' ExpectEq 2 F.Plural 'child' 'children'
